# is_orig: S7 treats originality as what lies beyond what unoriginal minds can foresee. A1 asserts it in that same sense, so P1 and A1 use one sense.
# A2 joins "see what it would do for them" (S6) to "feel the use of" (S5). These are different claims, each read as the minds' failure to perceive its value, so A2 is not a bridge.
# more_left: C adds "ought to be" around the claim, but what would make the claim true is the same as in A5 and A4.
